{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471910",
      "title": "Animating Staggered Lists",
      "sourceHash": "f8550d0bb0b29aef826dc60c20165474250533a69b2b9bcff8ae1879c44c7895",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.48,
          "end": 2.13,
          "en": "So now that we're animating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.59,
          "en": "the appearance of those images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.59,
          "end": 7.35,
          "en": "we can also explore another nice feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.35,
          "end": 10.26,
          "en": "offered by Framer Motion that helps with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.26,
          "end": 13.743,
          "en": "animating list items like this list of images here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.91,
          "end": 17.79,
          "en": "Because often when rendering lists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.79,
          "end": 21.54,
          "en": "you don't want all list items to appear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.54,
          "end": 25.23,
          "en": "and be animated at exactly the same point of time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.23,
          "end": 27.99,
          "en": "But instead, you might want to have them animated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.99,
          "end": 30.93,
          "en": "step-by-step, after each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.93,
          "end": 33.99,
          "en": "And this is a technique that's called staggering.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.99,
          "end": 38.58,
          "en": "You want to stagger that animation of those list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.58,
          "end": 40.38,
          "en": "So you wanna play them after each other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.38,
          "end": 42.213,
          "en": "instead of simultaneously.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.05,
          "end": 45.15,
          "en": "And this is thankfully something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.15,
          "end": 48.6,
          "en": "that's pretty easy to achieve with Framer Motion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.6,
          "end": 50.91,
          "en": "For this, you have to go to the parent element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.91,
          "end": 54.12,
          "en": "of the list items that you do want to stagger.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.12,
          "end": 54.99,
          "en": "So in this case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.99,
          "end": 57.03,
          "en": "this unordered list element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.03,
          "end": 61.08,
          "en": "and replace it with a motion unordered list element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.08,
          "end": 63.093,
          "en": "of course also the closing tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.44,
          "end": 66.51,
          "en": "And with that done here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.51,
          "end": 71.07,
          "en": "since I'm using variance to activate these child animations,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.07,
          "end": 73.89,
          "en": "we should also add the variance prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.89,
          "end": 75.993,
          "en": "to this unordered list component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.83,
          "end": 78.39,
          "en": "Now here for my variants,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.39,
          "end": 80.82,
          "en": "I wanna set the visible variant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.82,
          "end": 83.03999999999999,
          "en": "so this variant here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.03999999999999,
          "end": 86.76,
          "en": "But here I'm not setting it to animate the opacity",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.76,
          "end": 89.31,
          "en": "or scale of this unordered list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.31,
          "end": 92.00999999999999,
          "en": "because I am happy with that default look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.00999999999999,
          "end": 93.39,
          "en": "and behavior of that list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.39,
          "end": 96.06,
          "en": "I don't wanna animate the list as a whole",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 96.06,
          "end": 98.343,
          "en": "I just want to animate the list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 99.24000000000001,
          "end": 102.84,
          "en": "And therefore I'll not set any of those properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 102.84,
          "end": 105.24000000000001,
          "en": "but instead, when using variance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 105.24000000000001,
          "end": 108.93299999999999,
          "en": "you can also set the special transition property here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 109.86,
          "end": 112.97999999999999,
          "en": "which allows you to apply the same configuration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.97999999999999,
          "end": 115.2,
          "en": "you are applying with the transition prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.2,
          "end": 116.49000000000001,
          "en": "to the entire component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 116.49000000000001,
          "end": 119.34,
          "en": "and all the animations on that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.34,
          "end": 121.89,
          "en": "to a specific animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 121.89,
          "end": 123.06,
          "en": "And this, by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.06,
          "end": 126.18,
          "en": "is not just possible for variants",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.18,
          "end": 128.88,
          "en": "because whilst often you might want to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 128.88,
          "end": 132.93,
          "en": "globally configure all animations on a component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 132.93,
          "end": 136.63,
          "en": "you can always add this transition property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 137.61,
          "end": 140.22,
          "en": "to control just the exit animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 140.22,
          "end": 143.37,
          "en": "and to use different settings for the exit animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 143.37,
          "end": 145.92000000000002,
          "en": "than you're using for all the other animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 145.92000000000002,
          "end": 147.873,
          "en": "on this component, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 149.46,
          "end": 150.87,
          "en": "So that's always possible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 150.87,
          "end": 152.67000000000002,
          "en": "not just when using variants,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 152.67000000000002,
          "end": 154.29,
          "en": "but when using variants",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 154.29,
          "end": 157.56,
          "en": "I can set this transition on my visible variant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 157.56,
          "end": 161.22,
          "en": "on this parent component of those list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 161.22,
          "end": 164.19299999999998,
          "en": "to set a special configuration option here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 165.09,
          "end": 168.78300000000002,
          "en": "And that's the staggered children configuration option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 170.43,
          "end": 174.78,
          "en": "And this option can be used to control the delay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.78,
          "end": 179.19,
          "en": "by which these child elements in this parent element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 179.19,
          "end": 181.383,
          "en": "will start their animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 182.7,
          "end": 186.12,
          "en": "By default, they will all start simultaneously,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 186.12,
          "end": 188.43,
          "en": "but if you set stagger children",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 188.43,
          "end": 191.01,
          "en": "to any value that's not zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 191.01,
          "end": 196.01,
          "en": "so for example to 0.05, then this will be the delay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 196.98,
          "end": 200.28,
          "en": "between all those different child items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 200.28,
          "end": 203.85,
          "en": "So now the second item will start its animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 203.85,
          "end": 206.88,
          "en": "50 milliseconds after the first item",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 206.88,
          "end": 209.25,
          "en": "and the third item will start its animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 209.25,
          "end": 212.88,
          "en": "50 milliseconds after the second item and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 212.88,
          "end": 214.53,
          "en": "That's what this setting does,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 214.53,
          "end": 217.32,
          "en": "and you can of course play around with this time setting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 217.32,
          "end": 218.763,
          "en": "to see its impact.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 220.26,
          "end": 223.47,
          "en": "And by setting this, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 223.47,
          "end": 224.88,
          "en": "if we open this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 224.88,
          "end": 226.71,
          "en": "you now see that those images",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 226.71,
          "end": 229.14,
          "en": "don't appear simultaneously",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 229.14,
          "end": 230.853,
          "en": "but instead after each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 231.93,
          "end": 234,
          "en": "And this of course, is even easier to see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 234,
          "end": 237.87,
          "en": "if I use a bigger value here to add more delay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 237.87,
          "end": 240.96,
          "en": "between those different child item animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 240.96,
          "end": 244.11,
          "en": "Now you see they animate in really slowly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 244.11,
          "end": 245.08,
          "en": "after each other",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 246.27,
          "end": 247.95,
          "en": "and therefore it's of course up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 247.95,
          "end": 249.93,
          "en": "which value you want to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 249.93,
          "end": 252.96,
          "en": "I think it looks best if we use a very low value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 252.96,
          "end": 255.39,
          "en": "so that we have this staggering effect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 255.39,
          "end": 258.933,
          "en": "but overall still animate everything pretty quickly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 260.49,
          "end": 262.23,
          "en": "And that's how you can easily place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 262.23,
          "end": 264,
          "en": "such a staggering animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 264,
          "end": 267.153,
          "en": "for list items when using Framer Motion.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}